d development tools, agents, and the future of software engineering</div>\n            <div class=\"date\">April 7, 2026</div>\n        </header>\n\n        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <section class=\"new-products\">\n                <h2>🆕 New Products</h2>\n                <div class=\"empty-section\">\n                    No new products discovered today. Check back tomorrow for the latest agentic coding tools and platforms.\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>📋 Whitelist Updates</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/releases/tag/v1.3.38-vscode\" target=\"_blank\">Continue v1.3.38 for VSCode</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"update-type\">Release</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Pre-release builds available for multiple platforms including Alpine Linux, macOS ARM64, and other architectures.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>📅 2026-03-27</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">GitHub</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-feedback negative\">\n                        <div class=\"quote\">Users experiencing rate limit errors with Claude Sonnet (429 errors) and GPT-5 (400 errors)</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">Source: GitHub Issues #12057, #12056</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-feedback positive\">\n                        <div class=\"quote\">Community contributed OpenRouter provider support with dynamic model loading and fuzzy search UI improvements</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">Source: GitHub PR #8738</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n                <h2>💡 Technical Insights</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/6/google-ai-edge-gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">Google AI Edge Gallery - Local Gemma 4 Models on iPhone</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Google released an official app for running Gemma 4 models directly on iPhone with image Q&A, audio transcription, and tool calling widgets.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>Simon Willison</span>\n                        <span class=\"source blog\">Blog</span>\n                        <span>📅 Apr 6</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">local-llms</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">gemini</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">mobile-ai</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/datasette/datasette-ports/releases/tag/0.2\" target=\"_blank\">datasette-ports 0.2 Released</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Tool to find all currently running Datasette instances and list their ports. Now works standalone without Datasette.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>Simon Willison</span>\n                        <span class=\"source blog\">Blog</span>\n                        <span>📅 Apr 6</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">datasette</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">developer-tools</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">python</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/06/openai-alums-have-been-quietly-investing-from-a-new-potentially-100m-fund/\" target=\"_blank\">OpenAI Alums Launch $100M Investment Fund</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        OpenAI alumni have been quietly investing from a new potentially $100M fund, showing continued financial activity in the AI space.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>TechCrunch</span>\n                        <span class=\"source tech-media\">TechMedia</span>\n                        <span>📅 Apr 6</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tags\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">openai</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">investment</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">vc</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/06/google-quietly-releases-an-offline-first-ai-dictation-app-on-ios/\" target=\"_blank\">Google Quietly Launches Offline-First AI Dictation App on iOS</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Google quietly released an AI dictation app that works offline on iOS, similar to the AI Edge Gallery app for running local models.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span>TechCrunch</span>\n                    